[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3327987099","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110854#issuecomment-3327987099","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110854","id":3327987099,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GXQ2b","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-24T11:38:05Z","updated_at":"2025-09-24T11:38:05Z","body":"See the discussion in PR #93722\n\nIn Godot 4.4 and earlier, invisible nodes were excluded from export. If this was optional by default, we could end up changing the display of models exported by the user without their knowledge. The required by default choice ensures that user models are always rendered correctly (or not at all), and users have to opt-in to allow their models to be rendered incorrectly.\n\nAside from this setting, if it was desired for an invisible Godot thing to be visible in Blender, another option is to make it visible in Godot, changing the Godot scene to match the appearance it would have in Blender.\n\nRegardless, the ultimate solution is for Blender to implement this, so I opened an issue: https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Blender-IO/issues/2597","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3327987099/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3328049420","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110854#issuecomment-3328049420","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110854","id":3328049420,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GXgEM","user":{"login":"m4rr5","id":446570,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NjU3MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/446570?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4rr5","html_url":"https://github.com/m4rr5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4rr5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4rr5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4rr5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4rr5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4rr5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4rr5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4rr5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4rr5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4rr5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-24T11:55:20Z","updated_at":"2025-09-24T11:55:20Z","body":"So would it be fair to say that in 4.5 excluding invisible nodes should also be the default? That would be another way to fix the incompatibility today (until Blender adds this feature).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3328049420/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3328128375","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110854#issuecomment-3328128375","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110854","id":3328128375,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GXzV3","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-24T12:15:18Z","updated_at":"2025-09-24T12:15:31Z","body":"Excluding by default makes sense from the perspective of behaving like Godot 4.4, but from a long-term perspective, we want such nodes to exist in the file, so we would want to change the default value to the current value anyway later on.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3328128375/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3328165190","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110854#issuecomment-3328165190","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110854","id":3328165190,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GX8VG","user":{"login":"m4rr5","id":446570,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NjU3MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/446570?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4rr5","html_url":"https://github.com/m4rr5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4rr5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4rr5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4rr5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4rr5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4rr5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4rr5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4rr5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4rr5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4rr5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-24T12:25:22Z","updated_at":"2025-09-24T12:25:22Z","body":"Okay, I now realize that my PR should not change the default to VISIBILITY_MODE_INCLUDE_OPTIONAL, but to stay backwards compatible, it should have been VISIBILITY_MODE_EXCLUDE.\n\nI also agree with your remark though. Later on (and we can obviously debate when that is exactly) this default should change back to VISIBILITY_MODE_INCLUDE_REQUIRED. My personal opinion is that this time is not now, given how Blender handles loading these files, but obviously that is just an opinion.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3328165190/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3348068864","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110854#issuecomment-3348068864","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110854","id":3348068864,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Hj3oA","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-29T16:58:56Z","updated_at":"2025-09-29T18:32:55Z","body":"Regardless of the choices made in the engine, I don't want to leave you hanging. Changing the visibility mode from code works great and is the intended solution, but also, in case you want to force it to always happen, including when exporting from the editor UI with default settings, you can add one of these addons to your project:\n\n[exclude_invisible_nodes.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22602518/exclude_invisible_nodes.zip) or [strip_required_khr_node_visibility.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22602520/strip_required_khr_node_visibility.zip)\n\nPart of the reason we wanted to get this change into the engine sooner rather than later is because it is not possible to do the inverse from GDScript, so it is not possible in Godot 4.4 and earlier to force Godot to export invisible nodes from GDScript, but it is possible to force Godot 4.4 and later to never export a given node (as of #96468).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3348068864/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]